// A node must emit the representation its own TYPE declares — every
// consumer classifies on `abi_kind(node.typ())`. Arithmetic computes in
// the OPERANDS' register scalar, and here `filter_err`'s parameter
// (`['a, Error<'e>]`) unified into the multiply's unbound `'a: Number`
// cell, so the let's value classified TWO WORDS WIDE while the arith
// emitted a bare F64. `bind_local` declared the local I64 and defined
// it with an F64: cranelift PANICS ("declared type of variable var3
// doesn't match type of value v20"), which aborts the runtime thread —
// the oracle sees "runtime did not respond". Any narrow scalar does it
// (f32/i32/u32); i64 hid it, its payload word being I64 already.
// Found aug25a (ryouko divergence_000012, aieka divergence_000009);
// present at 6e62fff3, so older than that campaign's delta.
filter_err({let x = f64:0. * f64:0.; x})
